		{"id":"9acb7d2d67ed040d","x":-817,"y":-520,"width":454,"height":146,"type":"text","text":"Around the entire island for 5 kilometers is a raging storm that never ends, treacherous whirlpools and crackling thunder scrap against ships destroying them before ever reaching the island.\n"},
